I made two little updates to the sortloot patch (thanks to Chris Mears for
the ideas):

- escaped the # character in the diff for Guidebook.tex
- now the sorting ignores the singular/plural difference in stackable
  items (for example "a cursed scroll of identify" and "3 blessed scrolls
  of identify" are listed next to each other)

I also updated the combined patch (nh343jl.diff) to have these changes.

The new versions are downloadable at
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nethack.html

and here's an incremental diff for those of you who had an earlier version
of nh343jl.diff installed:

